<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A5.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix E Additional Discussion ‣ Stable Part Diffusion 4D: Multi-View RGB and Kinematic Parts Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Relation to optimization-based methods.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix E Additional Discussion ‣ Stable Part Diffusion 4D: Multi-View RGB and Kinematic Parts Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations and future work.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
